[3.901487, "o", "Bundled skills:\r\n    smithy-docs-navigator\r\n\r\nSupported harnesses (installed state under .):\r\n    claude  ->  .claude/skills/<skill>/SKILL.md\r\n        smithy-docs-navigator  [not installed]\r\n    kiro  ->  .kiro/skills/<skill>/SKILL.md\r\n        smithy-docs-navigator  [not installed]\r\n\r\nNot yet supported (these read a single instructions file, not a SKILL.md skills directory; an adapter is planned):\r\n    codex - codex CLI has no SKILL.md skills directory; it reads AGENTS.md project instructions\r\n    copilot - GitHub Cop"]
[3.901605, "o", "ilot has no SKILL.md skills directory; it reads .github/copilot-instructions.md, .github/instructions/*.instructions.md, or AGENTS.md\r\n    gemini - Gemini CLI has no SKILL.md skills directory; it reads a GEMINI.md context file\r\n"]
[3.915028, "o", "\r\n"]
